          <h3>Orbit</h3>
          <p><strong>AI relational memory app for maintaining a network.</strong></p>
          <p>Orbit converts freeform relationship notes into structured, searchable memory. The product supports capture-before-auth onboarding, Google sign-in, Supabase persistence, semantic search, follow-up lanes, and OpenAI-backed extraction with local development fallbacks.</p>
