          <p><strong>Agentic marketing platform scaffold.</strong></p>
          <p>BrandAware is a Next.js and Supabase product foundation for planning campaigns, generating content sprints, managing post strategy, and using brand DNA as context for AI-assisted marketing workflows.</p>
